          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મધ (madh) is a semi-tatsama: Sanskrit madhu, \"honey, mead\", borrowed after the old sound changes had run their course and then lightly reshaped. CDIAL lists no Gujarati form under madhu; the inherited line shows in Prakrit mahu, where the dh had worn to h (CDIAL 9784)."
            }
          ]
        },
